      "policy_id": "refunds",
      "text": "A paid invoice can be refunded in full within 60 days when the customer was charged twice, the visit was cancelled by Acme, or the work was not carried out. Only the account holder can ask for a refund, after identity verification. Refunds reach the original payment method within 5 working days. Partial refunds and goodwill credits need a manager.",
      "title": "Refunds"
     },
     "verification": {
      "policy_id": "verification",
